#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:151
msgid ""
"The names documented in this section are DOM interfaces. With the exception "
"of :class:`Node` and the exception classes, they are not provided by the :"
"mod:`!xml.dom` module itself, but by concrete DOM implementations, such as :"
"mod:`xml.dom.minidom`."
msgstr ""
"本節中所紀錄的名稱是 DOM 介面。除了 :class:`Node` 和例外類別之外，它們並非"
"由 :mod:`!xml.dom` 模組本身提供，而是由具體的 DOM 實作提供，例如 :mod:`xml."
"dom.minidom`。"

